  "limits": [
    "No Docker daemon or Compose execution: rootless bubblewrap tested the digest-verified extracted image filesystem, original entrypoint and PostgreSQL binaries.",
    "Image extraction excluded device nodes and did not preserve numeric ownership; bubblewrap supplied isolated /dev and mapped invoking user to postgres UID70.",
    "No TCP or external network; proof used local Unix sockets under private /tmp. TLS and container network connectivity remain integration checks.",
    "Disposable fixture administrator owns the scratch probe table. This does not demonstrate Stead namespace roles, authorization, API, canonical domain, or audit/outbox integration.",
    "Initial socket-directory override broke the image entrypoint internal psql setup; default /tmp socket corrected the harness. Earlier output and partial synthetic data were preserved.",
    "Run the database script only with a fresh empty database fixture directory: random bootstrap password is intentionally not retained after execution.",
    "No production dependency or image acceptance is self-approved by this evidence."
  ],
